# Purpose: §44 ended with a cheaper explanation than either branch of §36's fork — "the sequence
# terminated its own host". Testing that needs NO shot and NO game: load the same DLL bytes in a
# process this script owns and see whether it dies without being touched. If it does, every live
# observation from §31 to §44 has been observing a self-kill, and the "environment vs engine"
# question was framed on the wrong axis.
# Second purpose, added when the first one came back positive: pin WHERE it dies using only the
