# DLL under test: stellaris_quickjs.dll, sha256 863917f2579ae8c4472be13baeca4bed64dc2ccffc7b620fdb2b016134a86617,
#   deployed as C:\temp\sqjs_s43.dll (the same bytes as §42's and §44's). Verified this session:
